	(text "C304 (100 nF) sets an output slew rate of approximately 0.5 V/ms, giving\na nominal 48 ms ramp to 24 V. Increasing C304 slows startup and reduces\ncapacitive inrush. Closing JP301 grounds SHDN_N and disables U301.\nReopening JP301 enables operation and can reset an overload latch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 95.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "137166dc-8b8c-4493-8d52-6e934a76bc9c")
	)
	(text "R301-R304 set the input operating window: approximately 16.63 V turn-on\nand 38.80 V overvoltage cutoff. Hysteresis gives approximately 15.55 V\nundervoltage shutdown and 36.28 V recovery from overvoltage.\nR305 (5.1 kOhm) sets the nominal current limit to 3.53 A. After power-good\nasserts, TPS26631 permits approximately 7.06 A for a nominal 25.5 ms pulse.\nMODE is open, selecting latch-off after a sustained overload."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "14671321-aec0-42bd-a2be-3beddc7a5961")
	)
	(text "Voltage and current limits"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 63.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1ea1c1f4-8b0e-40eb-8876-0d5ef4a59921")
	)
