	(text "R308-R310 set the PGTH threshold to approximately 16.20 V rising and\n15.16 V falling. PG_INPUT asserts only when the output passes this\nthreshold and U301's internal pass transistor is fully enhanced.\nR307 pulls this open-drain signal up to AON."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9bf60572-005c-4fa1-80d4-9a553a0b2f8a")
	)
	(text "+24V_FUSED supplies U301 (TPS26631) through Q301 (IRFR3410). U301 controls\nQ301 via B_GATE; Q302 provides gate pull-down under DRV control. Together\nwith U301, these transistors provide reverse-polarity and reverse-current\nprotection. The protected output is EFUSE_OUT. C301-C303 decouple the input;\nC305 decouples the output. D301 clamps negative output transients."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.86 45.446 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c97bd917-9d8e-4bc3-bee8-3244cc851a8b")
	)
